.TH CHM-IDE 1
.SH NAME
chm-ide \- list, install and verify supported development environments
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B bash tools/ides/ide-manager.sh list
.br
.B bash tools/ides/ide-manager.sh install vscodium
.br
.B bash tools/ides/ide-manager.sh verify
.SH DESCRIPTION
Uses an existing host package manager to install VSCodium, an open-source distribution
of the VS Code editor. The installer does not mirror proprietary Microsoft binaries,
execute downloaded installers, or silently install extensions. Linux uses the user
Flatpak remote, Windows uses winget, and macOS uses Homebrew when available.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 on success; 1 if verification fails; 64 for unsupported arguments; 69 if no supported
package manager is installed.
